SUMMARY:Living More Magic Less Manic: How to Go Sane in Crazy Times
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nSpiritual awakenin
 g is the answer to solve all the world’s problems! The Universe is alive
  and loves you with everything you need to forever thrive\, starting from 
 an abundant healthy planet that naturally connects you with infinitely man
 y new magical worlds. Then why are so many people scared of such a beautif
 ul truth\, as they fear and suffer psychological crises\, psychic attacks\
 , and spiritual psychosis? These and more are the symptoms of incomplete a
 wakening\, which only more awakening can cure. It’s no coincidence that 
 negative belief systems and domination cultures try to keep you paranoid a
 nd ignorant\, because the more you learn the more you know that they never
  controlled you. Join us this Sunday Sept 20\, 2026 for a free comforting 
 grounding talk on how to reframe your whole life and reality to instantly 
 become more loved\, healthy\, and free.\n\nThe deeper truth is that you ar
 e the Universe experiencing itself from your own position\, complete with 
 your own beliefs to filter your perceptions of paradise. Your lifestyle is
  the antenna that you tune to the radio station of a reality you wish to r
 eceive. All time is simultaneous and every possibility is available in the
  eternal now. Life is a consciousness journey\, so whatever you expect to 
 experience\, that you will get more of until you change your own mind. Oth
 er people can only offer examples of what’s possible. Nobody else can ma
 ke you experience anything without your permission.\n\nSo the only real pr
 oblem occurs when you don’t believe in what’s good for you and buy int
 o somebody else’s lifestyle instead. What works for them may not work fo
 r you\, so only your own emotions can help you decide. Trying to be happy 
 by doing what makes you unhappy is crazy-making\, leading to the many form
 s of mental and physical illness that people suffer today. Fortunately\, w
 aking up to your truth only becomes easier as all the other options shut d
 own. This is why Earth is now on the brink of both disaster and rebirth\, 
 with the pivot point being your own power to choose. The sooner you face y
 our own hopelessness\, the sooner the new hope will reach you.\n\nBeliefs 
 are your models for reality that include your definitions\, expectations\,
  assumptions and interpretations. The Source is all positive and loving\, 
 but only true positive beliefs will help you to experience a good life in 
 the Universe that’s alive and loves you. When a person buys into false n
 egative beliefs\, they start thinking paranoid thoughts and feeling attack
 ed. The Universe isn’t actually attacking by nature\, so the beliefs are
  inherently untrue. But any experience can be staged\, so the people who h
 old onto false beliefs will meet each other and become free to attack each
  other. This is the basis of domination cultures where love and cooperatio
 n aren’t trusted. Instead\, fear and threats of harm are used to force p
 eople to perform and obey. It never really works because people always do 
 what they want secretly. Thus\, domination cultures tend to be very shallo
 w and materialistic\, to maximize the appearance of outer success for a sy
 stem that’s really failing inside.\n\nWhen people wake up spiritually\, 
 they shift from seeing the physically staged controlled reality to feeling
  the emotional consequences of their belief systems. Instead of buying int
 o the old lies of working hard and fighting to dominate\, the spiritual se
 nses reveal the eternal now where the real energetic patterns become frigh
 teningly obvious. Daily routines that seemed so predictable and controlled
  become full of connections to other realities that show the direction eac
 h person is headed. This is how life always worked\, with perceptions of s
 pirits\, energies\, and synchronicities to foretell the futures that we ca
 n always change just by changing ourselves. But people who deny their own 
 power will run back to the old abusive lifestyles for comfort\, and thus m
 any folks stay willfully ignorant as long as they can. Stories of ghosts\,
  demons\, and psychic attack become part of the drama to keep people scare
 d of real enlightenment.\n\nFor new levels of health and happiness\, we’
 ll see how reality was never for physical conquering but rather spiritual 
 communication to build relationship with the Source through your own highe
 r self in the spirit human partnership. We’ll bust the myths of psychic 
 dangers\, and compare modes of perception including dreams\, synchroniciti
 es\, other lives\, and the clairs (clairvoyance\, etc). We’ll see how to
  master fear and anger to leave false belief systems\, and conclude with a
  guided meditation to enjoy your own soul’s destiny.\n\nWelcome! Our Inn
 er Selves Mastery spiritual support group is free online every Sunday 11am
 -130pm EDT\, with the last 30 minutes for a guided meditation. If you can
 ’t stay you can get the recording. You can signup here for this meeting 
 and visit www.signupISM.com for all events\, newsletter\, videos\, and mor
 e.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nInner Selves Mastery\nspiritua
 l teaching and coaching\nquick-links at [www.signupISM.com](http://www.sig
 nupISM.com)
