SUMMARY:Bachata Takeover & Performance @ Komana Brewery 
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n🔥💃 SALSA4LIF
 E PRESENTS: BACHATA TAKEOVER! 🕺🔥\n\nGet ready to turn up the BACHATA
  and take over the dance floor! ❤️‍🔥\nThis night\, we’re puttin
 g the spotlight on the sensual rhythms\, smooth footwork\, and irresistibl
 e energy of Bachata!\n\n🎶 HEAVY ON THE BACHATA with a sprinkle of Salsa
  & Merengue\n💃 Salsa & Bachata Lesson I 7:30-8:30pm\n🕺 Social Dancin
 g I 8:30pm-11pm\n🎧 DJ Giovanni bringing the Bachata vibes\n\nSpecial Ba
 chata Dance Performance by Hector & Janayra from La Luz Dance Company! Che
 ck out their Bachata classes - 4 week series every Thursday at La Luz Danc
 e Studio in Raleigh.\nInfo: LaLuzDanceCo.com\n\n🎁 Stick around for a ch
 ance to win free door prizes after the lesson!\n\n🔥 Drink specials all 
 night!\n❄️ Air-conditioned venue\n🪩 Spacious dance floor\n💲 $10 
 B4 9pm (Early bird special) I $15 after 9pm!\n📍 KōMANA Brewing Co. 102
 0 Ryan Rd\, Cary\, NC\n🚗 Free parking\n🔞 18+ to party | 21+ to drink
 \n\nBring your partner. Bring your friends. Bring your best Bachata moves.
 \nWhether you're a seasoned dancer or you've never danced Bachata before 
 — COME TAKE OVER THE FLOOR WITH US!\n\nEarly Bird Tickets at Salsa4Life.
